[01:05.67] He'd buy a hundred pounds of yeast and some copper line
[01:11.75] Everybody knew that he made moonshine
[01:17.25] Now the revenue man wanted Grandaddy bad
[01:20.32] He headed up the holler with everything he had
[01:23.86] It's before my time but I've been told
[01:26.40] He never come back from Copperhead Road
[01:30.56] 
[01:41.69] Now daddy ran the whiskey in a big block Dodge
